  <Nodes>k__BackingField:
  - <ID>k__BackingField: f1ec621e-f765-4935-ae03-f0e5339aa71c
    <Name>k__BackingField: NC2
    <Text>k__BackingField: "I\u2019m just looking for my master\u2019s writings,
      and I know he lived in this village. Would you know anything?\r\r\t"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 81328b49-d62d-4dbd-b52b-22eb32d627c9
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 040b63a8-225f-4392-96e7-32220ca91d8b
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 106.4, y: -248.79999}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 81328b49-d62d-4dbd-b52b-22eb32d627c9
    <Name>k__BackingField: NC3
    <Text>k__BackingField: "No, not at all. To be honest, I\u2019m only passing through
      this village, rumors have brought me here, but for now I haven\u2019t really
      found what I came here for. "
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 4cde4569-dc6e-481b-8f0b-a31d828bb740
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 040b63a8-225f-4392-96e7-32220ca91d8b
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 724.8, y: -248}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Yume
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 4cde4569-dc6e-481b-8f0b-a31d828bb740
    <Name>k__BackingField: NC4
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Well, I\u2019ll let you take care of your giant owl then
      and I\u2019ll visit the village. If I ever find a track by looking for my master\u2019s
      work, what have you come to look for ?"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 8bfa876e-28d7-4a10-aa0e-404b9bc5cec2
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 040b63a8-225f-4392-96e7-32220ca91d8b
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1595.2, y: -248}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 8bfa876e-28d7-4a10-aa0e-404b9bc5cec2
    <Name>k__BackingField: NC5
    <Text>k__BackingField: "I don\u2019t really know if you\u2019ll find anything,
      but I came to look for the ruins of one of the mage clans who participated
      in the Fires of Decline."
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 040b63a8-225f-4392-96e7-32220ca91d8b
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2505.6, y: -248.79999}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Yume
  - <ID>k__BackingField: d0a4ce07-976d-481e-9c80-7e75f2deb568
    <Name>k__BackingField: C1
    <Text>k__BackingField: "What do you want from me ? I\u2019m a bit rushed, so
      I can\u2019t really have a chat with you."
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 7810fc0c-5b30-44bc-9e3a-a155c8943cdc
