  - <ID>k__BackingField: d731367f-7a67-494d-b24b-0064f4d4002d
    <Name>k__BackingField: NC1
    <Text>k__BackingField: "What do you want from me ? I\u2019m a bit rushed, so
      I can\u2019t really have a chat with you."
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: f1ec621e-f765-4935-ae03-f0e5339aa71c
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 040b63a8-225f-4392-96e7-32220ca91d8b
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -429.6, y: -248.79999}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Yume
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 7810fc0c-5b30-44bc-9e3a-a155c8943cdc
    <Name>k__BackingField: C2
    <Text>k__BackingField: Yes I know, but if I remember correctly it was you who
      was looking for the ruins of the mage clan that caused this war a millennium
      ago ?
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: d41f7ed2-5209-4572-9749-c3a37cece401
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 86d71f02-4594-429b-9446-972a7e553378
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 76.8, y: 125.6}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: d41f7ed2-5209-4572-9749-c3a37cece401
    <Name>k__BackingField: C3
    <Text>k__BackingField: "IT WASN\u2019T... Excuse me, I got carried away. Yes,
      I was the one looking for the ruins, do you know anything ?"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 7c9cad79-dce4-4a23-980a-812e93604852
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 86d71f02-4594-429b-9446-972a7e553378
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 872.8, y: 124.799995}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Yume
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 7c9cad79-dce4-4a23-980a-812e93604852
    <Name>k__BackingField: C4
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Someone in the village told me to go look above a root
      field. I also have to go there to see something related to my master\u2019s
      work that I told you about."
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 0524f2d3-e72a-4d0f-9a35-13709b6a1eea
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 86d71f02-4594-429b-9446-972a7e553378
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1500, y: 124.799995}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 0524f2d3-e72a-4d0f-9a35-13709b6a1eea
    <Name>k__BackingField: C5
    <Text>k__BackingField: "I suggest you team up for this little adventure.\r"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: fc98cd0a-a091-4f8c-9f8f-81b4c66e6b30
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
