      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 86d71f02-4594-429b-9446-972a7e553378
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 2354.4, y: 124.799995}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: fc98cd0a-a091-4f8c-9f8f-81b4c66e6b30
    <Name>k__BackingField: C6
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Come on, for once, a little company won\u2019t hurt Zmiraa
